Yellow River Wheat Irrigation

The repository is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The application adds wheat growth-stage scenarios, gross water-supply
accounting, forecasting, packaging, and reports. This copy uses the
pyqpanda_alg QAOA implementation as its default scheduling backend, with
NumPy and classical alternatives available explicitly.

The bundled demonstration parameters are synthetic. Agronomic background and
parameter descriptions are documented in docs/SOURCES.md.
